Sample answer: “Tell me about yourself”
I am a Java Full Stack Developer with around 10 years of experience in software development. My primary skills include Core Java, Spring, Spring Boot, REST APIs, SQL, and enterprise application development.
I have experience working on application development, debugging, defect resolution, and supporting business-critical applications. I also collaborate with cross-functional teams and contribute to understanding requirements and delivering solutions.
I am now looking for an opportunity where I can use my experience, strengthen my skills in modern Java and microservices architecture, and take greater ownership of technical delivery.




Adapt the answer to your actual hands-on experience and the technologies listed on your resume. Avoid claiming expertise in a technology you cannot explain in a technical interview.
