Useful phrases:
- If you have a notice period: “My official notice period is 90 days. I can check whether an early release is possible, but I would prefer to confirm only after discussing it with my employer.”
- If you are serving notice: “I’m currently serving my notice period, and my expected last working day is [date].”
- If you can join immediately: “I’m available to join immediately, subject to completing the required documentation.”
Never promise immediate joining unless you can genuinely meet that commitment.
