Sample answer: “Do you have any other offers?”
I’m exploring suitable opportunities that align with my technical experience and career goals. I’ll evaluate each opportunity based on the role, technology stack, compensation, and growth prospects. I’ll communicate transparently if I receive an offer that affects my availability or decision timeline.




If you do have an offer, answer honestly. Do not invent competing offers to negotiate a higher salary.
